        {
          "class": "DepictionMarkdownView",
          "markdown": "<p>Reads <strong>.ips</strong> crash reports from <code>/var/mobile/Library/Logs/CrashReporter</code> and groups them by process.</p><p>The crashed thread is scanned for a tweak dylib and shown as <strong>culprit Zetsu.dylib</strong> or <strong>unknown</strong>.</p>",
          "useRawFormat": true
